  zune-jpegxl   MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR Zlib    JPEG XL, lossless
    https://crates.io/crates/zune-jpegxl/0.5.2

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
jpeg-encoder's forward DCT (src/fdct.rs, src/avx2/fdct.rs) is ported from
mozjpeg and carries the IJG's terms; the rest of the crate is MIT OR
Apache-2.0.
